   "questMeta": [
    [
     "Cyoria: independent study and local aftermath",
     "Committed campaign facts own this local agreement. Actual local retrieval, research and continuing life are independent retained consequences.",
     "Cyoria · independent academy visitor",
     2
    ]
   ],
   "shops": [
    "book.mol.academy.shop"
   ],
   "npcDesc": [
    "Own household, costs, chores and guests. Guest work is an original explicit agreement; no automatic home ownership or private family knowledge.",
    "Academy representative and invocation teacher. Guest library permission, practical competence and commercial certification are distinct.",
    "Library assistant with actual books/materials, work and attention. A received observation is separate from author knowledge.",
    "Formula teacher who requires understanding and functional reconstruction. Her own attuned mana anchors a narrow authored device; she shares neither mastery nor personal source.",
    "Demanding mentor evaluates attention and controlled procedure. This paid guest exercise is manual device control, not a copied mage faculty.",
    "Recent graduate seeking paid retrieval work with trained physical/combat means. She can receive a bounded survey and refuse an unsafe plan; no invulnerable escort.",
    "Widowed healer/alchemist with scarce supplies and a daughter. Early guest collaboration and numerical budgets are original proposals; research privacy and family time remain his.",
    "Third-year student following his own ordinary studies. His private perceptions, later loop discoveries and memories are not the visitor’s knowledge.",
    "Original independent local scavenger guarding a short hatch for salvage. Own hook, meal, finite effort and purse; no sourced antagonist identity or future intelligence. Intervention changes actual injury/position/means."
   ],
